{"src":"it","tgt":"en","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":231300,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"en","src":"it","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"nonprofit","context":true},{"kind":"input","t":11327.877,"text":"Tuttavia, riguardo a questo aspetto, lo spazio Schengen funziona piuttosto come un unico paese."},{"kind":"text","t":12066.380315,"text":"However, regarding this aspect, the Schengen area functions rather like a single country."},{"kind":"audio","t":12275.878215,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":12280.35445,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1040},{"kind":"audio","t":12285.660371,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":110,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":12290.924643,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":12294.290456,"samples":24928,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":440},{"kind":"input","t":22557.403679,"text":"La grotta poggia sulla sommità di una delle montagne a nord della Mecca, completamente distaccata dal resto del mondo."},{"kind":"text","t":23520.112887,"text":"The cave sits atop one of the mountains north of Mecca, completely detached from the rest of the world."},{"kind":"audio","t":23666.414705,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":23671.750046,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":23677.066477,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":23682.627603,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":23685.222120000002,"samples":30328,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":690},{"kind":"input","t":33140.4257,"text":"Oggi tutti scrivono i messaggi sugli schermi dei computer e non hanno mai la necessità di avvicinarsi a un temperamatite."},{"kind":"text","t":34082.09948,"text":"Today everyone writes messages on computer screens and never has the need to go near a pencil sharpener."},{"kind":"audio","t":34246.444246,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":34251.959544,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":34257.121717,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":34262.466628,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":34267.778489000004,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":34269.742126,"samples":17360,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":90},{"kind":"input","t":44060.356736,"text":"I viaggiatori diretti verso paesi con imposte elevate a volte possono risparmiare parecchio, specie su prodotti come gli alcolici e il tabacco."},{"kind":"text","t":44967.981857,"text":"Travelers heading to countries with high taxes can sometimes save a lot, especially on products such as alcohol and tobacco."},{"kind":"audio","t":45079.565357,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":45084.880028,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":45090.251078,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":45095.51326,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":45101.054207,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":45106.179711,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":45109.047653,"samples":21192,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":260},{"kind":"input","t":50908.991544000004,"text":"Le piante elaborano il proprio nutrimento con il sole"},{"kind":"text","t":51413.384002,"text":"Plants produce their own food using the sun."},{"kind":"audio","t":51523.647494,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":51529.053964,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":51531.186658,"samples":18464,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":140},{"kind":"input","t":55908.540017,"text":"Tramite la fotosintesi. Inoltre fanno ombra."},{"kind":"text","t":56187.64233,"text":"Through photosynthesis. They also provide shade."},{"kind":"audio","t":56295.152469,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":56297.713336,"samples":20032,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":310},{"kind":"audio","t":56376.191321,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":56378.770888,"samples":22432,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":390},{"kind":"input","t":62735.575507,"text":"L'ospedale ha seguito il protocollo per il controllo delle infezioni."},{"kind":"text","t":63093.414771,"text":"The hospital followed the infection control protocol."},{"kind":"audio","t":63200.88972,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":63206.125923,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":63210.592918,"samples":31064,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":680},{"kind":"input","t":67842.825766,"text":"compreso l'isolamento del paziente, per evitare che altri possano infettarsi."},{"kind":"text","t":68318.89254799999,"text":"including patient isolation, to prevent others from becoming infected."},{"kind":"audio","t":68426.97540699999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":68428.19467699999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":68429.754221,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":68431.040149,"samples":32496,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":750},{"kind":"input","t":79605.576919,"text":"L'attività svolta è stata per lo più teorica, ma il programma è stato scritto per simulare i rilievi effettuati della galassia del Sagittario."},{"kind":"text","t":80515.738497,"text":"The activity carried out was mostly theoretical, but the program was written to simulate the surveys conducted of the Sagittarius galaxy."},{"kind":"audio","t":80636.471939,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":80641.904459,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":80647.092112,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":80652.60310099999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":80658.03537,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":80663.370491,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":80668.29452899999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":800},{"kind":"audio","t":80668.644554,"samples":1624,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":87003.45916799999,"text":"Nella città di Barcellona le lingue ufficiali sono il catalano e lo spagnolo."},{"kind":"text","t":87604.10612499999,"text":"In the city of Barcelona, the official languages are Catalan and Spanish."},{"kind":"audio","t":87717.693046,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":87722.77548099999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":87728.481546,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":87733.51502199999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":880},{"kind":"audio","t":87733.82129699999,"samples":1528,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":92010.876184,"text":"All'incirca metà della popolazione preferisce parlare il catalano."},{"kind":"text","t":92560.320503,"text":"Roughly half of the population prefers to speak Catalan."},{"kind":"audio","t":92722.473386,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":92727.93567499999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":92733.972845,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":940},{"kind":"audio","t":92734.107832,"samples":4296,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":99173.740402,"text":"La stragrande maggioranza è in grado di comprenderlo. Lo spagnolo è conosciuto praticamente da tutti."},{"kind":"text","t":99624.69466,"text":"The vast majority are able to understand it. Spanish is known by practically everyone."},{"kind":"audio","t":99736.28422399999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":99739.45731099999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":99740.44741499999,"samples":25664,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":430},{"kind":"audio","t":99957.579262,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":360,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":99962.68366699999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":99964.283461,"samples":15464,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":20},{"kind":"input","t":107195.399754,"text":"In certe zone è sufficiente far bollire l'acqua per un minuto, in altre occorrono molti minuti."},{"kind":"text","t":108030.279254,"text":"In some areas, boiling the water for one minute is sufficient; in others, many minutes are required."},{"kind":"audio","t":108141.263798,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":108146.155057,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":108151.55646699999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":108153.404436,"samples":15696,"rate":24000},{"kind":"audio","t":108227.865127,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":108233.081201,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1230},{"kind":"audio","t":108233.67343099999,"samples":10064,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":115590.49421199999,"text":"Le piante danno il loro meglio quando si trovano nel loro ambiente naturale."},{"kind":"text","t":116081.05501099999,"text":"Plants thrive best when they are in their natural environment."},{"kind":"audio","t":116190.641708,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":116195.778413,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":116200.828149,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":690},{"kind":"audio","t":116201.147384,"samples":696,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":124791.15878999999,"text":"Quindi resistete alla tentazione di prenderne anche solo un esemplare."},{"kind":"text","t":125286.306703,"text":"So resist the temptation to take even a single specimen."},{"kind":"audio","t":125395.33780899999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":125400.70102899999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":125405.914783,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1120},{"kind":"audio","t":125406.222407,"samples":8496,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":135032.64426200002,"text":"Negli anni venti, gli atteggiamenti prevalenti di gran parte dei cittadini"},{"kind":"text","t":135693.340441,"text":"In the twenties, the prevailing attitudes of a large part of the citizenry"},{"kind":"audio","t":135803.863802,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1230},{"kind":"audio","t":135808.730061,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":250,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":135813.93652400002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":135818.159294,"samples":29496,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":650},{"kind":"input","t":139570.757446,"text":"e delle nazioni erano il pacifismo e l'isolamento."},{"kind":"text","t":140051.779393,"text":"and of the nations were pacifism and isolationism."},{"kind":"audio","t":140151.602953,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":140156.711068,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":140162.32854400002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":960},{"kind":"audio","t":140162.59977,"samples":4296,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":148969.89652100002,"text":"Il mosasauro era il super predatore della sua era e per questo non temeva nulla, se non gli altri mosasauri."},{"kind":"text","t":149908.93507900002,"text":"The mosasaur was the apex predator of its era and for this reason feared nothing, except other mosasaurs."},{"kind":"audio","t":150029.155169,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":150034.321203,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":150039.426428,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":150044.72462,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":150050.25395800002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":150054.704654,"samples":31160,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":730},{"kind":"input","t":162728.096479,"text":"Fin dalla fondazione di Asunción, avvenuta nel 1537, il Paraguay è stato in grado di mantenere gran parte della sua identità e delle sue peculiarità autoctone."},{"kind":"text","t":163774.750007,"text":"Since the founding of Asunción in 1537, Paraguay has been able to maintain much of its identity and indigenous peculiarities."},{"kind":"audio","t":163901.136624,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":163906.425537,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":163911.61614,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":920},{"kind":"audio","t":163916.897582,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":110,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":163922.290333,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":163927.438587,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":163932.788838,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":163933.976028,"samples":15424,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":50},{"kind":"input","t":172018.11825,"text":"I maiali sono portatori della malattia che successivamente viene trasmessa all'uomo tramite le punture di zanzare."},{"kind":"text","t":172734.526622,"text":"Pigs are carriers of the disease that is subsequently transmitted to humans through mosquito bites."},{"kind":"audio","t":172851.962728,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":172857.25843000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":172862.60659100002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":172867.743756,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":172873.245864,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1090},{"kind":"audio","t":172873.560449,"samples":7160,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":183232.851322,"text":"La maggior parte dei moderni telescopi destinati alla ricerca sono enormi strutture in zone sperdute, dove le condizioni atmosferiche sono favorevoli."},{"kind":"text","t":183912.95057800002,"text":"Most modern research telescopes are enormous structures in remote areas where atmospheric conditions are favorable."},{"kind":"audio","t":184033.56643200002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":184038.522629,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":184043.804582,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1170},{"kind":"audio","t":184049.06585400001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":100,"off":1300},{"kind":"audio","t":184054.216848,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":340,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":184059.449781,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":184060.994026,"samples":14592,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":192024.533984,"text":"Molte persone non si immaginavano pazienza e consapevolezza fossero necessarie anche per chi rientra in patria."},{"kind":"text","t":192830.342758,"text":"Many people did not imagine that patience and awareness were necessary even for those returning to their home country."},{"kind":"audio","t":192950.257343,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":192955.425007,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":192960.50845300002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":192965.884043,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":192971.208645,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":192975.65152100002,"samples":30560,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":630},{"kind":"input","t":199686.15551500002,"text":"probabilmente quindi la notazione è stata apposta solo come un'etichetta"},{"kind":"text","t":200178.433385,"text":"So the notation was probably added only as a label."},{"kind":"audio","t":200287.67302800002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":200292.761723,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":70,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":200297.957497,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":870},{"kind":"audio","t":200298.226902,"samples":2496,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":207684.580193,"text":"Eppure gli uccelli hanno molte caratteristiche che li accomunano ai dinosauri."},{"kind":"text","t":208135.956303,"text":"Yet birds have many characteristics in common with dinosaurs."},{"kind":"audio","t":208248.433712,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":208253.614666,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":208258.998167,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":208261.60832300002,"samples":20496,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":290},{"kind":"input","t":219762.519543,"text":"Si tratta principalmente di spiagge sabbiose, sicure per il nuoto e la maggior parte di esse gode dell'ombra degli alberi di Poutukawa."},{"kind":"text","t":220856.602282,"text":"These are mainly sandy beaches, safe for swimming, and most of them enjoy the shade of Poutukawa trees."},{"kind":"audio","t":221023.24826000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":221024.738235,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":221026.26177,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":970},{"kind":"audio","t":221027.81045400002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":221029.425827,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":221029.94044900002,"samples":20360,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":280},{"kind":"input","t":227773.25576600002,"text":"Duval, sposato con due figli adulti, non ha destato un grande interesse in Miller."},{"kind":"text","t":228473.513347,"text":"Duval, married with two adult children, did not arouse much interest in Miller."},{"kind":"audio","t":228584.826635,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":228589.91388100001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":228594.967746,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":228600.461025,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1200},{"kind":"audio","t":228601.222562,"samples":10528,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":231075.075507,"text":"a cui ha raccontato la storia."},{"kind":"text","t":231421.604082,"text":"to whom he told the story."},{"kind":"audio","t":231528.047242,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":231531.360617,"samples":26632,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":530},{"kind":"close","t":241605.425105,"code":1005}]}